* A vsect label plus an external equate in one field (Block+Field(a6)): r68 writes a local and an
* external reference there, l68 adds both; one ELF relocation can't, so a link-time expression
* of the label's section's alias (a hidden global at the bss's start) and the equate, the label's
* offset added (6, 8). Folding sys.l's value did it before, for sys.l's equates only.
* fixed: 2aefb81 2026-10-12 No folding of a library's equates: a label plus external equates as a link-time expression; -sysl= and rof2elf's -e gone
* expect text: 2d480000 302e0000
* expect reloc: R_68K_16          r68x_a4de017a+0x00000006
* expect reloc: R_68K_16          r68x_a4de017a+0x00000008
* expect sym: B r68l_lab_ext_data_bss 00000000
 psect lab_ext_data,0,0,0,0,0
 vsect
Pad ds.w 3
Block ds.l 4
 ends
 move.l a0,Block+Field(a6)
 move.w Block+Field+2(a6),d0
 ends
